{"content_text": "{\"protocolSection\":{\"identificationModule\":{\"nctId\":\"NCT06593938\",\"orgStudyIdInfo\":{\"id\":\"HRS-5965-301\"},\"organization\":{\"fullName\":\"Chengdu Suncadia Medicine Co., Ltd.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"},\"briefTitle\":\"A Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Oral HRS-5965 in Adult Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria (PNH) Patients Who Are Naive to Complement Inhibitor Therapy\",\"officialTitle\":\"A Multicenter, Randomized, Open-label, Active-comparator Controlled Phase III Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of HRS-5965 Capsule in Patients With Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\"},\"statusModule\":{\"statusVerifiedDate\":\"2025-09\",\"overallStatus\":\"COMPLETED\",\"expandedAccessInfo\":{\"hasExpandedAccess\":false},\"startDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2024-10-25\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"primaryCompletionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-07-31\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"completionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-07-31\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"studyFirstSubmitDate\":\"2024-09-10\",\"studyFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2024-09-10\",\"studyFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2024-09-19\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"lastUpdateSubmitDate\":\"2025-09-10\",\"lastUpdatePostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2025-09-11\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"sponsorCollaboratorsModule\":{\"responsibleParty\":{\"type\":\"SPONSOR\"},\"leadSponsor\":{\"name\":\"Chengdu Suncadia Medicine Co., Ltd.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"}},\"oversightModule\":{\"isFdaRegulatedDrug\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDevice\":false},\"descriptionModule\":{\"briefSummary\":\"A study of the efficacy and safety of HRS-5965 capsules compared to eculizumab for 24 weeks in patients with PNH.\"},\"conditionsModule\":{\"conditions\":[\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\"]},\"designModule\":{\"studyType\":\"INTERVENTIONAL\",\"phases\":[\"PHASE3\"],\"designInfo\":{\"allocation\":\"RANDOMIZED\",\"interventionModel\":\"PARALLEL\",\"primaryPurpose\":\"TREATMENT\",\"maskingInfo\":{\"masking\":\"NONE\"}},\"enrollmentInfo\":{\"count\":76,\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"armsInterventionsModule\":{\"armGroups\":[{\"label\":\"HRS-5965 capsule\",\"type\":\"EXPERIMENTAL\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: HRS-5965 capsule\"]},{\"label\":\"Eculizumab Injection\",\"type\":\"EXPERIMENTAL\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: Eculizumab Injection\"]}],\"interventions\":[{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"HRS-5965 capsule\",\"description\":\"HRS-5965 capsule for 24 weeks\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"HRS-5965 capsule\"]},{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"Eculizumab Injection\",\"description\":\"Eculizumab Injection for 24 weeks\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"Eculizumab Injection\"]}]},\"outcomesModule\":{\"primaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Proportion of subjects with the hemoglobin levels are ≥ 12 g/dL at least on three out of four measurements in the absence of red blood cell transfusions\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"}],\"secondaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Proportion of subjects with the change from baseline in hemoglobin is ≥ 2 g/dL at least on three out of four measurements in the absence of red blood cell transfusions\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"},{\"measure\":\"Proportion of subjects who absence of administration of red blood cell transfusions\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"},{\"measure\":\"Mean change from baseline in hemoglobin\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"},{\"measure\":\"Mean percent change from baseline in LDH levels\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"},{\"measure\":\"Mean change from baseline in reticulocyte counts\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"},{\"measure\":\"Mean change from baseline in FACIT-Fatigue scores\",\"timeFrame\":\"24 weeks\"}]},\"eligibilityModule\":{\"eligibilityCriteria\":\"Inclusion Criteria:\\n\\n1. Diagnosis of PNH confirmed by flow cytometry with clone size \\\\> 10%.\\n2. Have not received complement inhibitor therapy;\\n3. LDH \\\\> 1.5\\\\*ULN at screening.\\n4. Hemoglobin level \\\\< 10 g/dL at screening.\\n\\nExclusion Criteria:\\n\\n1. Known or suspected hereditary or acquired complement deficiency;\\n2. Patients with laboratory evidence of bone marrow failure (reticulocytes \\\\<100x109/L; platelets \\\\<30x109/L; neutrophils \\\\<0.5x109/L);\\n3. Presence or suspicion of a systemic active bacterial, viral, or fungal infection (based on judgment of the investigator) within 2 weeks prior to the first dose of HRS-5965;\\n4. History of infection with capsular bacteria (e.g., meningococcus, pneumococcus, etc.)\\n5. Positive of HIV, HBsAg or HCVAb.\",\"healthyVolunteers\":false,\"sex\":\"ALL\",\"minimumAge\":\"18 Years\",\"stdAges\":[\"ADULT\",\"OLDER_ADULT\"]},\"contactsLocationsModule\":{\"locations\":[{\"facility\":\"Peking Union Medical College Hospital, Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences\",\"city\":\"Beijing\",\"state\":\"Beijing Municipality\",\"zip\":\"100730\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":39.9075,\"lon\":116.39723}},{\"facility\":\"The Blood Disease Hospital of the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences\",\"city\":\"Tianjin\",\"state\":\"Tianjin Municipality\",\"zip\":\"300020\",\"country\":\"China\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":39.14222,\"lon\":117.17667}}]},\"ipdSharingStatementModule\":{\"ipdSharing\":\"UNDECIDED\"}},\"derivedSection\":{\"miscInfoModule\":{\"versionHolder\":\"2026-09-18\"},\"conditionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"D006457\",\"term\":\"Hemoglobinuria, Paroxysmal\"}],\"ancestors\":[{\"id\":\"D000743\",\"term\":\"Anemia, Hemolytic\"},{\"id\":\"D000740\",\"term\":\"Anemia\"},{\"id\":\"D006402\",\"term\":\"Hematologic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D006425\",\"term\":\"Hemic and Lymphatic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D009190\",\"term\":\"Myelodysplastic Syndromes\"},{\"id\":\"D001855\",\"term\":\"Bone Marrow Diseases\"}]},\"interventionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"C481642\",\"term\":\"eculizumab\"}]}},\"hasResults\":false}", "media_type": "application/json", "text_derivation": {"extractor_version": "stdlib-json-object-slice-v1", "method": "ctgov-study-json-v1", "raw_asset": {"byte_size": 722762, "media_type": "application/json", "relative_path": "evidence/raw/sha256/5e/5e055f4c38b521ee0b77d8d55c403955f543e6800db21245bd2d1bf36e7b4a14.bin", "sha256": "5e055f4c38b521ee0b77d8d55c403955f543e6800db21245bd2d1bf36e7b4a14"}, "record_selector": {"nct_id": "NCT06593938", "study_index": 7}, "schema_version": "1.0", "text_sha256": "6bcb31ede43acb18393dd7798a0c28d0ad9e780692a78ca4bab8607bff8a7608"}}